    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 745a7f666834c3e4da40c0b7d9a887f9, type: 3}
        text: Luka is comparing three lyric sheets under the planetarium's projected
          stars.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d3a5bc610201eb478a2254bfd3ac559, type: 3}
        text: Three versions? Which one are you using?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -2199009814668414564, guid: 25eb3c64c8a9d4e4dbac7f14ab53122f, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I haven't decided yet.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1414087313690171253, guid: bd2e8b9a35e8b5740a210eeda43ff22c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Oh, good. My own ending's still a mess.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -6467469513183496125, guid: 64258669bcda46446a650c15765c381a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 672266309e3b51746a62a805028a9457, type: 3}
        text: You don't seem especially worried.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 848881099071188197, guid: 991781bd03c8bb64192e8c3d64485d96, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bdece2fc8ba803b4c867ad555238b938, type: 3}
        text: Ask me again when we're onstage!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5531041605552728420, guid: 8a62fd28134ed2841aa676a65b561ae9, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: 'A folded note beside Luka''s music stand reads: ''For whoever sings
          it next.'''
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d3a5bc610201eb478a2254bfd3ac559, type: 3}
        text: Is that from whoever wrote your song?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -2199009814668414564, guid: 25eb3c64c8a9d4e4dbac7f14ab53122f, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f97c4c4f3f9059843b2b0e0e76996353, type: 3}
        text: I wish I knew.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1414087313690171253, guid: bd2e8b9a35e8b5740a210eeda43ff22c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6413765225731377329, guid: 223e40f6c18a8a24f9fe703075349e06, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: They could've signed it, at least.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -6467469513183496125, guid: 64258669bcda46446a650c15765c381a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -3625801319181296996, guid: 5b2718ca832c9604fac87a62bc7d626b, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb110a468ad187045a96b110eb1098b6, type: 3}
        text: There isn't much else to go on.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Well, I hope they get to hear you sing it!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5784461528446217249, guid: 0d1a9c5c749493e4db30ed7310bc43ef, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
